          <dt>Sources OK</dt><dd>IMF PortWatch primary; Lloyds List Intelligence or UANI Iran Shipping tracker as secondary. Flag AMBIGUOUS if sources disagree by more than 20% on the weekly average.</dd>
          <dt>Ambiguity</dt><dd>Vessels transiting exclusively under naval escort without AIS tracking may count if officially logged by escorting navy; purely military transits do NOT count. If all primary/secondary data sources are unavailable, resolve AMBIGUOUS.</dd>
